'''China''' is the 3rd stage in [[Empire of Cats]]. [[Those Guys]] are introduced here. Upon completion in Chapter 1, [[Axe Cat (Normal Cat)|Axe Cat]] will be available to unlock from the [[Upgrade Menu]].

