==Battleground==
*3 [[Doge]]s spawn after 0.67 seconds<sup>20f</sup>, delay 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.
*3 [[Snache]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.
*2 [[Those Guys]] spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.
*2 [[Snache]]s spawn after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>, delay 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.

==Strategy==
====Chapter 1====
Keep deploying [[Cat (Normal Cat)|Cats]], with the occasional [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|Tank Cat]] as they are your only two units.

====Chapters 2 & 3====
Spam [[Cow Cat (Normal Cat)|Cow Cats]].

