==Trivia==
*In the [[Nyanko Daisensou|Japanese version]], this stage takes place in '''Kagoshima Prefecture'''. In the Taiwanese version, stage 3 is set in '''Thailand''' and China is moved to [[Thailand (Empire of Cats)|stage 4]].
*Kagoshima Prefecture is Japan's largest manufacturer of sweet potatoes, hence why its base has one on top.
*Prior to [[Version 11.7 Update|version 11.7]], there were 4 extra [[Snache]]s which spawned after bringing the enemy base down to 50% HP, with a delay of 1-2 seconds between each Snache.
*This stage was changed in [[Version 15.4 Update|Version 15.4]], giving player 2 [[Battle Items|Treasure Radars]] (100%) for completing it for the first time.

